  "_doc": "Each y-row maps to one schema field. Each option {x, value} is one checkbox. needs_visual on an option means: if THAT specific checkbox is detected as checked, AHK GUI shows an Open-PDF button so the radiologist reads the handwritten companion text. The `label` field mirrors the marker shown on _page1_annotated.png — `T<n>` = template-only (never observed in corpus, blue marker).",
